-BlueDevil runtime dependencies:
-    -bluez5
-        -General Bluetooth management
+Floss-only BlueDevil integration
+========================
 
-    -bluez-obexd
-        -Be able to "Browse File" aka kio_obexftp
-        -Be able to "Send Files" (bluedevil-sendfile)
-        -Be able to receive files
+This integration retains Plasma's Bluetooth tray and System Settings UI and connects
+both directly to Floss. It does not depend on BluezQt, provide a BlueZ-compatible
+API, or support a second Bluetooth backend.
 
-    -pulseaudio-module-bluetooth
-        -Be able to connect A2DP profile
+The implementation, supported features and current limits are described in
+src/floss/README.md. This is uncompiled integration work. No tests, compilers,
+toolchain downloads or runtime checks have been run for these changes.
+
+The upstream translation catalogs and handbook source remain for provenance;
+the old handbook is not installed and does not describe this integration's feature set.
